mcp-server-datovka (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a hand-written manpage (mcp-server-datovka(1)) and a --help
    flag on the binary, resolving lintian's no-manual-page warning.
  * Add mcp-server-datovka.svg to README.md.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 16 Jul 2026 12:45:34 +0200

mcp-server-datovka (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add send_message tool for sending new messages with attachments.
  * Add send_text_message tool: composes plain text as a PDF and
    sends it, so an LLM agent can write a message without an
    existing file to attach.
  * Add find_data_box tool: looks up a recipient's data box ID,
    preferring the offline seznamds directory (fast, unlimited) and
    falling back to the live ISDS search API. Recommends: seznamds.
  * Depend on python3-datovka (>= 0.2.0), python3-fpdf, and
    fonts-dejavu-core.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 16 Jul 2026 10:43:27 +0200

